{
 "topic": "Climate change and Pakistan's economic future",
 "essay": {
  "outline": [
   "Intro: climate emergency",
   "Agriculture and wheat",
   "Floods and finance",
   "Energy and solar",
   "Conclusion"
  ],
  "paragraphs": [
   {
    "id": "p1",
    "kind": "intro",
    "text": "Pakistan faces a growing climate emergency. This essay argues that spending on adaptation is the central economic question of the decade.",
    "pageIndex": 0
   },
   {
    "id": "p2",
    "kind": "body",
    "text": "Agriculture is the first sector hit by warming. Wheat yields in Punjab fell by about ten percent after the 2022 heatwave, according to the Economic Survey. Heat also shortens the wheat sowing window.",
    "pageIndex": 0
   },
   {
    "id": "p3",
    "kind": "body",
    "text": "Floods have damaged public finances badly. Many people agree with this view.",
    "pageIndex": 0
   },
   {
    "id": "p4",
    "kind": "body",
    "text": "Some argue that development must come before adaptation spending. This is a common opinion in many countries.",
    "pageIndex": 0
   },
   {
    "id": "p5",
    "kind": "body",
    "text": "Education has been neglected for decades in Pakistan and the problem keeps growing. Teachers are underpaid and syllabi are outdated in most public schools across the country. Many schools lack basic facilities such as classrooms, desks and clean drinking water.",
    "pageIndex": 0
   },
   {
    "id": "p6",
    "kind": "body",
    "text": "Throughout history great nations have risen through unity and hard work. Every society faces challenges and Pakistan is no different. Where there is a will there is a way.",
    "pageIndex": 0
   },
   {
    "id": "p7",
    "kind": "body",
    "text": "Solar power can cut the fuel import bill. Pakistan spent about 17 billion dollars on fuel imports in 2022, according to the State Bank of Pakistan.",
    "pageIndex": 0
   },
   {
    "id": "p8",
    "kind": "conclusion",
    "text": "In conclusion, spending on adaptation protects growth. The time to act is now.",
    "pageIndex": 0
   }
  ],
